    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d520-a1">

                <pb facs="0515" n="439" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg439"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Text of Russo-Japanese Treaty</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Imperial Japanese Government and the Imperial Russian Government resolved to
                    unite their efforts to maintain permanent peace in the Far East, have agreed
                    upon the following:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">Article I</p>
                <p>Japan will not become a party to any political arrangement or combination
                    directed against Russia.</p>
                <p>Russia will not become a party to any political arrangement or combination
                    directed against Japan.</p>
                <pb facs="0516" n="440" xml:id="pg440"/>
                <p rendition="#center">Article II</p>
                <p>In case either the territorial rights or the special interests in the Far East of
                    one of the contracting parties, recognized by the other contracting party,
                    become menaced, Japan and Russia will confer upon the measures to be taken with
                    a view to mutual support and cooperation for the safeguarding and defense of
                    these rights and interests.</p>
                <p>In faith whereof, the undersigned, duly authorized by their respective
                    Governments, have signed this convention and have affixed their seals
                    thereto.</p>
                <p>Done at Petrograd, the third day of the seventh month of the fifth year of
                    Taisho, corresponding to July three/June twenty, one thousand nine hundred and
                    sixteen.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">I. Motono</hi>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sasonow</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
